# The desk with the mistakes of the troubleshooting page: the status bar,
# Messages, the constraints excluded, and the sheet of lamp with its warning
# and its error, in a taller bottom row.
open docs/instances/guide-b-desk-errors-broken.json
select constraint lamp
panel messages
# The border between the canvas and the panels under it, dragged up; the
# pointer then leaves it, which would stay highlighted.
drag L 300 691 300 400
move 1590 10
wait 29
shot errors.ppm
